# app.sem — the entry operation for the manifest fixture, so the project's
# `entry main` (declared in build.sem) resolves to a real operation and the
# fixture checks clean as a complete project. (Added for R-104/SS1194: a
# dangling project entry is now a lint error.)

taskApp is module
taskApp path taskApp
taskApp exports main
taskApp purpose "Entry module for the manifest test app"
taskApp invariant "main is the only project entry operation"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32
ExitCode purpose "Process exit status"

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main async no
main memory heap no
main purpose "Return a clean exit code"
main invariant "Always returns ExitCode 0"
main return ok
main let ok immutable ExitCode 0
